# Everything in here is ignored except the scaffold. The ENCRYPTED vault is ignored
# too: committing ciphertext is OPT-IN (CFG-869), not the default — a public or shared
# repo should not carry it unless you decided so, and once committed every old
# ciphertext stays in history. To opt in, add this line below:
#   !vault.json.enc
# (or run `git add -f setup/secrets/vault.json.enc` once; a tracked file stays tracked).
*
!.gitignore
!vault-manage.sh
!vault.json.example
